            </tbody></table>
                                <table width="80%" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                            <tbody><tr>
                                <td class="subheader" style="padding-top:0px;text-align:center;font-size:12px !important;">
                                    Rating Rationale <br/><br/>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody></table>
                            <table width="80%" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                                <tbody><tr>
                                    <td class="normalfont" align="left" style="font-size: 12px !important;text-align: justify !important;text-justify: inter-word !important;">
                                        <span class="normalfont" style="font-size: 12px !important;font-family:'Times New Roman';text-align: justify !important;text-justify: inter-word !important;">
                                            <div style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">Acuité has reaffirmed the long-term rating to<strong>&nbsp;’ACUITE A-’ (read as ACUITE A Minus)&nbsp;</strong>on&nbsp;Rs 1175.00 Cr.&nbsp;Bank Loan facilities of SRG Housing Finance Limited (SHFL) and is on&nbsp;<strong>Rating Watch with Developing Implications.</strong><br>
<br>
Acuité has reaffirmed the long-term rating to<strong>&nbsp;’ACUITE A-’ (read as ACUITE A Minus)&nbsp;</strong>on&nbsp;Rs 76.00 Cr.&nbsp;&nbsp;Non Convertible Debentures facilities of SRG Housing Finance Limited (SHFL) and is on&nbsp;<strong>Rating Watch with Developing Implications.</strong><br>
<br>
­Acuité has reaffirmed the long-term rating to<strong>&nbsp;’ACUITE A-’ (read as ACUITE A Minus)&nbsp;</strong>on&nbsp;Rs 124.00 Cr. Non Convertible Debentures facilities of SRG Housing Finance Limited (SHFL) and is on&nbsp;<strong>Rating Watch with Developing Implications.</strong></span></span></div>

                                        </span>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr><td><br></td></tr>
                            </tbody></table>
                            <table class="table table-bordered" width="80%" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                                        <tbody><tr><td class="subheader class14">Update for this Press Release</td></tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                            <p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">Acuite notes that there are media reports concerning an investigation by the <strong>National Housing Bank (NHB)</strong>, regarding suspected anomalies in certain loan accounts, their potential impact on NHB’s refinance exposure, and reports suggesting a 'Red Flagged Account' (RFA) classification. SRG Housing Finance Limited vide a stock exchanges filling dated September 10, 2026, has issued an official notification on exchanges, with regards to “Clarification on Market Rumours and False News Articles”. As per the filing made with the exchanges&nbsp;the company has denied and rejected the observations, allegations and implications reported in these articles. The company further said that the NHB audit is ongoing and is&nbsp;not yet concluded.</span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">The rating has been placed under Watch with Developing Implications for Acuite to closely monitor the progress related to these developments.</span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'">Acuite will continue to engage with the management of SRG Housing and closely monitor the progress related to the aforesaid developments. Acuité will try to understand its impact on the company’s financial profile, liquidity position and asset quality, if any and will endeavour to resolve the rating watch at the earliest.<br>
<br>
For all other sections, kindly refer to the previous Rating&nbsp;Rationale available<strong>&nbsp;</strong>through&nbsp;this&nbsp;link:&nbsp;<a href="https://connect.acuite.in/fcompany-details/SRG%20HOUSING%20FINANCE%20LIMITED/8th_May_26" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline">Press Release </a>&nbsp;</span></span></p>

                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr><td> &nbsp;</td></tr>
                            </tbody></table>
