			<td style="text-align:center">(%)</td>
			<td style="text-align:right">0.65</td>
			<td style="text-align:right">0.61</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<em>*Total income equals to Net Interest Income plus other income</em>
                                        </td>
